# House In Hand — Product Requirements Document (PRD)
*Full platform + Public Website + Admin-Managed CMS*

---

## 1. Product Overview

To build a secure, scalable, and user-friendly digital property management and rental platform that centralizes the full housing lifecycle — from property discovery to rental management, payments, legal agreements, and utility billing.

House In Hand replaces fragmented, manual rental processes with a unified digital ecosystem that improves transparency, trust, and efficiency for all stakeholders.

The platform enables:

- Seamless property discovery and rental execution
- Structured and automated rent payments
- Digitized legal agreements with e-signatures
- Transparent landlord–tenant relationships
- Centralized estate and portfolio management
- A public marketing website that converts visitors into registered users, with all content editable by admins without a code deploy

**Two front-facing surfaces:**

| Surface | Audience | Auth required |
|---|---|---|
| **Public Website** (marketing site) | Anonymous visitors, prospective tenants/landlords, SEO/organic traffic | No |
| **App / Platform** (web + mobile) | Registered users (Student, Tenant, Landlord, Estate Manager) | Yes |
| **Admin Console** | Internal staff (Content Editors, Ops/KYC reviewers, Super Admins) | Yes (internal roles) |

