**Homepage section components (each independently editable):**

| Section | Editable fields |
|---|---|
| Hero | Headline, subheading, background image/video, primary + secondary CTA buttons |
| Trust/Stats bar | Configurable counters (e.g. "X verified listings", "Y cities covered") |
