## 7. Security & Compliance

**Identity Security:** Email/phone verification, KYC per profile, RBAC access control, profile-level audit logs

**Fraud Prevention:** Duplicate profile prevention, device monitoring, identity validation checks, suspicious activity detection

**Data Security:** AES-256 encryption (data at rest), TLS encryption (data in transit), secure document storage, encrypted payments

**Compliance:** NDPR compliance, digital signature legality, audit logging for regulators, secure retention of agreements

**Admin Console Security:** Separate auth realm from customer accounts, mandatory MFA for Super Admin, all content publishes logged with admin ID + timestamp for audit trail

