**Trust:** KYC completion rate, Verified profiles %, Fraud incidents, Agreement completion rate

**Engagement:** Active tenants, Active landlords, Active managers, Messaging usage

**Website (new):** Visitor → Signup conversion rate, Bounce rate, Avg. session duration, Blog organic traffic, Time-to-publish for content edits

