## 9. Success Criteria

**Onboarding:** Email/phone registration, Profile creation, KYC upload, Profile switcher UI

**Rental Flow:** Search → Apply → Approve → Sign → Pay

**Payments:** Scheduling, Reminders, Tracking dashboard

**Trust Layer:** Verified badges, Ratings & reviews, Secure agreements

**Website & CMS (new):** Public site live with editable homepage, blog, and FAQs; Content Editor can publish a change without engineering support; visitor-to-signup funnel is trackable end to end

The platform is successful when:
- End-to-end rentals are completed digitally; listings convert into active leases
- Rent defaults reduce significantly; utility payments are processed digitally
- Verified landlords actively list properties; verified tenants actively transact
- 90%+ KYC completion rate; fraud remains minimal; agreements are fully digital and stored securely

