## 10. Assumptions & Risks

**Assumptions:** Users accept KYC onboarding; digital payments are widely adopted; landlords adopt digital workflows; utility APIs are available; content editors can operate the CMS without engineering support

**Risks:** Low trust in digital listings; KYC friction; fraudulent listings; regulatory changes; payment failures; slow landlord adoption; stale/unmanaged website content if no one owns CMS updates

